  "title": {
    "rendered": "Contact"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n    <main role=\"main\" class=\"flex-grow\">\n        <section class=\"bg-white border-b border-gray-100 py-12\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight\">Contact Our Experts</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl\">Backed by 20+ years of hands-on HVAC experience. We provide 24/7 doorstep intervention in Vadodara and surrounding GIDCs.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12\">\n                \n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-7\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-8\">Send Us A Message</h2>\n                    <form id=\"contactForm\" class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 space-y-6\">\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                            <div>\n                                <label for=\"name\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold uppercase text-gray-500 mb-2\">Full Name *</label>\n                                <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none\" placeholder=\"John Doe\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <label for=\"phone\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold uppercase text-gray-500 mb-2\">Phone Number *</label>\n                                <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" required class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none\" placeholder=\"+91 00000 00000\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <label for=\"subject\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold uppercase text-gray-500 mb-2\">How can we help? *</label>\n                            <select id=\"subject\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none\">\n                                <option>Inverter AC PCB Repair</option>\n                                <option>Split AC Installation</option>\n                                <option>Gas Filling (R32/R410)</option>\n                                <option>Industrial Chiller Service</option>\n                            </select>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <label for=\"message\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold uppercase text-gray-500 mb-2\">Your Requirements</label>\n                            <textarea id=\"message\" rows=\"4\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none\" placeholder=\"Explain your issue...\"></textarea>\n                        </div>\n                        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full md:w-auto bg-primary text-white font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-sky-100 hover:scale-105 transition-all\">SEND INTERVENTION REQUEST</button>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n\n                <aside class=\"lg:col-span-5\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-dark text-white p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl h-full relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-primary/20 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div>\n                        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-10 relative z-10\">Direct Dispatch</h2>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"space-y-10 relative z-10\">\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-xl\"><i data-lucide=\"phone\" class=\"text-primary\"></i></div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-1\">Phone</p>\n                                    <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-xl font-bold hover:text-primary transition\">+91 97272 57141</a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-xl\"><i data-lucide=\"map-pin\" class=\"text-primary\"></i></div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-1\">Headquarters</p>\n                                    <p class=\"font-semibold leading-relaxed\">27, Payal Complex, Opp. M.S. University, Sayajigunj, Vadodara, 390005</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"mt-20 pt-8 border-t border-white/5\">\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 italic\">&#8220;Engineering the climate since 1996.&#8221;</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </aside>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"w-full h-[400px] border-y border-gray-100 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\">\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3691.03123456789!2d73.1812!3d22.3072!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x0!2zMjLCsDE4JzI1LjkiTiA3M8KwMTAnNTIuMyJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v123456789\" \n                    width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        lucide.createIcons();\n        // Simple Form Alert logic removed to keep structure pure.\n    </script>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "Contact Our Experts Backed by 20+ years of hands-on HVAC experience. We provide 24/7 doorstep intervention in Vadodara and surrounding GIDCs. Send Us A Message Full Name * Phone Number * How can we help? * Inverter AC PCB Repair Split AC Installation Gas Filling (R32/R410) Industrial Chiller Service Your Requirements SEND INTERVENTION REQUEST Direct [&hellip;]",
